-Stop!

590
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:42,800
Stop running!

591
00:23:42,880 --> 00:23:44,270
Stop! Stop there!

592
00:23:44,920 --> 00:23:46,680
Don't run! Do you hear me?

593
00:23:46,680 --> 00:23:47,440
Get him!

594
00:23:47,680 --> 00:23:48,440
Where is he?

595
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:49,960
-Get him!
-Catch him!

596
00:23:50,640 --> 00:23:51,500
Still running?

597
00:23:51,680 --> 00:23:52,540
Where are they?

598
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:54,720
