The 4 of them also drank a lot.

602
00:24:11,240 --> 00:24:13,240
And their lung capacity isn't good.

603
00:24:18,000 --> 00:24:20,510
You actually... actually hit him?

604
00:24:22,400 --> 00:24:23,550
Why is it different

605
00:24:23,550 --> 00:24:24,550
