608
00:24:29,070 --> 00:24:31,400
You'll know
after you hit a few more times.

609
00:24:38,590 --> 00:24:40,030
Okay, I'll go find them.

610
00:24:44,830 --> 00:24:45,960
Stop it.

611
00:24:45,960 --> 00:24:47,160
You really scared me.

612
00:24:50,200 --> 00:24:51,510
