Here, here on me.

617
00:25:06,030 --> 00:25:06,830
I've got it.

618
00:26:20,200 --> 00:26:21,130
Sit a bit closer.

619
00:26:43,720 --> 00:26:44,510
Ice.

620
00:26:45,480 --> 00:26:46,310
