621
00:26:46,750 --> 00:26:47,680
Ridiculous.

622
00:26:47,720 --> 00:26:48,510
No,

623
00:26:48,750 --> 00:26:49,550
I mean,

624
00:26:49,880 --> 00:26:51,750
