628
00:26:58,830 --> 00:27:00,110
But this time, no snow.

629
00:27:00,400 --> 00:27:01,200
We'll use ice.

630
00:27:02,960 --> 00:27:04,920
You mean the ice in the fridge?

631
00:27:05,960 --> 00:27:07,160
Not that kind of ice.

632
00:27:07,550 --> 00:27:09,680
Um... It has to be a large one.

633
00:27:09,680 --> 00:27:10,960
The larger, the better.

634
00:27:10,960 --> 00:27:12,480
Preferably the kind you can step on.

635
00:27:12,480 --> 00:27:13,720
It's spring.

636
00:27:14,000 --> 00:27:15,330
