643
00:27:36,060 --> 00:27:37,000
[Fantasy City of Aquamarine Star]

644
00:27:38,480 --> 00:27:39,310
Here we are!

645
00:27:39,050 --> 00:27:44,480
[Fantasy City of Aquamarine Star]

646
00:27:39,310 --> 00:27:40,110
This is it.

647
00:27:40,920 --> 00:27:42,590
When did this aquarium open?

648
00:27:42,590 --> 00:27:43,520
I didn't know it!

649
00:27:43,680 --> 00:27:44,680
It says

650
00:27:44,680 --> 00:27:45,810
the main attraction

651
00:27:45,830 --> 00:27:47,160
of this aquarium

652
00:27:47,160 --> 00:27:48,310
is the penguin show.

653
00:27:48,550 --> 00:27:49,680
Penguins are the clue!

654
00:27:49,680 --> 00:27:50,310
If there are penguins,

655
00:27:50,310 --> 00:27:51,960
