656
00:27:52,750 --> 00:27:54,720
Uncle Che, you're amazing.

657
00:27:54,720 --> 00:27:56,120
Let's keep a low profile.

658
00:27:56,550 --> 00:27:57,400
Are you ready?

659
00:27:58,070 --> 00:27:58,960
Are you ready?

660
00:28:00,200 --> 00:28:00,880
Three,

661
00:28:01,070 --> 00:28:01,720
two,

662
00:28:01,830 --> 00:28:02,400
one,

663
00:28:02,720 --> 00:28:03,510
let's go!

664
00:28:07,880 --> 00:28:09,510
Why isn't there even a ticket office?

665
00:28:09,510 --> 00:28:10,910
There's no one else here.

666
00:28:11,000 --> 00:28:12,030
Yeah.

667
00:28:12,350 --> 00:28:14,000
Did we come too early?

668
00:28:13,700 --> 00:28:17,250
[Ocean Kingdom]
[Paradise of Lovely Animals]

669
00:28:15,830 --> 00:28:16,720
It doesn't matter if it's empty,

670
00:28:16,720 --> 00:28:17,750
as long as there's ice,

671
00:28:17,750 --> 00:28:18,550
right?

672
00:28:29,440 --> 00:28:30,400
It's not even cold here.

673
00:28:30,400 --> 00:28:31,110
No.

674
00:28:31,640 --> 00:28:33,200
It's all melted into water, huh?

675
00:28:33,200 --> 00:28:33,960
Yeah,

676
00:28:33,960 --> 00:28:35,030
