684
00:28:50,440 --> 00:28:51,510
Where are they?

685
00:28:52,790 --> 00:28:54,350
They left for their hometown.

686
00:28:54,350 --> 00:28:55,350
T-They left?

687
00:28:55,720 --> 00:28:56,510
Hometown?

688
00:28:56,720 --> 00:28:57,640
The South Pole?

689
00:28:58,200 --> 00:28:59,270
How did they leave?

690
00:28:59,270 --> 00:29:00,440
By taxi.

691
00:29:01,110 --> 00:29:02,000
"How did they leave?"

692
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:03,720
It's been closed for so long,

693
00:29:03,790 --> 00:29:05,270
