694
00:29:05,270 --> 00:29:06,400
to see the penguins?

695
00:29:06,750 --> 00:29:07,750
Go... Get out.

696
00:29:08,550 --> 00:29:09,550
I just mopped the floor.

697
00:29:09,550 --> 00:29:10,440
Get out!

698
00:29:10,440 --> 00:29:12,070
-I-I'm sorry.
-Sorry for that.

699
00:29:12,070 --> 00:29:12,880
We'll leave in a bit.

700
00:29:12,880 --> 00:29:14,810
Yeah, we didn't know it was closed.

701
00:29:15,960 --> 00:29:17,960
