702
00:29:18,030 --> 00:29:19,070
Seriously.

703
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:22,270
What? Where is he?

704
00:29:23,720 --> 00:29:24,510
Uncle Che!

705
00:29:27,220 --> 00:29:32,100
[Underwater Tunnel]

706
00:29:27,510 --> 00:29:28,510
Uncle Che!

707
00:29:31,270 --> 00:29:32,720
Why did he go up there?

708
00:29:37,920 --> 00:29:38,720
Uncle Che!

709
00:29:40,000 --> 00:29:40,920
I promised Mingming

710
00:29:40,920 --> 00:29:41,790
I'd take good care of you.

711
00:29:41,790 --> 00:29:43,070
Can you not run around?

712
00:29:43,310 --> 00:29:44,070
Alright, alright.

713
00:29:44,070 --> 00:29:45,200
Keep quiet.

714
00:29:45,270 --> 00:29:47,270
It's sick. Can't you see it's sick?

715
00:29:49,200 --> 00:29:50,920
It doesn't look too well.

716
00:29:51,640 --> 00:29:52,680
It's listless.

717
00:29:53,240 --> 00:29:54,510
Dr. Liu, treat it.

718
00:29:55,750 --> 00:29:57,030
I'm not a vet.

719
00:29:57,240 --> 00:29:58,970
It's the same. You can treat it.

720
00:30:01,750 --> 00:30:03,070
Keep quiet, come on.

721
00:30:04,510 --> 00:30:05,640
Can't you understand me?

722
00:30:05,640 --> 00:30:07,480
I told you to get out of here.

723
00:30:07,960 --> 00:30:09,240
We're leaving soon.

724
00:30:09,240 --> 00:30:10,000
Sir,

725
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:11,000
