726
00:30:11,000 --> 00:30:12,200
What's it to you?

727
00:30:12,200 --> 00:30:13,720
If it's sick, it needs treatment.

728
00:30:13,720 --> 00:30:15,000
I'm even sicker than it is.

729
00:30:15,000 --> 00:30:16,400
Are you going to treat me?

730
00:30:16,640 --> 00:30:18,240
Mind your own business.

731
00:30:18,880 --> 00:30:19,920
It'll be sold in a couple of days.

732
00:30:19,920 --> 00:30:21,240
What does it have to do with you?

733
00:30:21,240 --> 00:30:21,920
Get down.

734
00:30:21,920 --> 00:30:22,880
Leave now.

735
00:30:23,110 --> 00:30:23,880
Get down.

736
00:30:23,880 --> 00:30:24,480
Get out!

737
00:30:24,480 --> 00:30:25,240
Got it, got it.

738
00:30:25,240 --> 00:30:26,510
We're leaving right away.

739
00:30:26,510 --> 00:30:27,310
Get down here!

740
00:30:27,310 --> 00:30:27,960
Good grief,

741
00:30:27,960 --> 00:30:29,070
