742
00:30:29,070 --> 00:30:30,310
Why are you so timid?

743
00:30:30,480 --> 00:30:31,880
-Let's go.
-Come down.

744
00:30:32,240 --> 00:30:34,000
Oh, no, it didn't work.

745
00:30:36,070 --> 00:30:38,480
What do you think seals usually eat?

746
00:30:39,440 --> 00:30:40,480
Fish, I guess?

747
00:30:41,510 --> 00:30:42,910
Frozen fish or live fish?

748
00:30:43,310 --> 00:30:44,770
Are they picky about this?

749
00:30:45,590 --> 00:30:47,850
Fewer bones would definitely be better.

750
00:30:50,310 --> 00:30:51,640
Would a cold storage

751
00:30:51,640 --> 00:30:52,840
for frozen fish work?

752
00:30:53,350 --> 00:30:54,640
We can pour water in it

753
00:30:54,640 --> 00:30:55,900
and freeze it into ice.

754
00:30:57,640 --> 00:30:58,590
It's worth a try.

755
00:30:59,070 --> 00:31:01,000
Then let's turn to my dad's friend.

756
00:31:01,030 --> 00:31:01,920
He's in the cold chain business

757
00:31:01,920 --> 00:31:03,850
and definitely has a cold storage.

758
00:31:03,880 --> 00:31:04,510
Okay.

759
00:31:05,110 --> 00:31:07,170
There shouldn't be any cameras here.

760
00:31:15,480 --> 00:31:16,550
We've found

761
00:31:16,590 --> 00:31:18,110
