762
00:31:18,510 --> 00:31:18,960
I've

763
00:31:18,960 --> 00:31:20,220
come up with a new plan.

764
00:31:20,270 --> 00:31:21,730
Let's use this rubber band

765
00:31:22,000 --> 00:31:23,350
instead of

766
00:31:24,400 --> 00:31:26,160
that fly swatter.

767
00:31:28,590 --> 00:31:30,270
I told you I don't want to cure it.

768
00:31:30,270 --> 00:31:31,750
Why are you not giving up?

769
00:31:31,750 --> 00:31:32,510
Amy.

770
00:31:33,270 --> 00:31:34,000
Give it a try.

771
00:31:34,070 --> 00:31:34,720
I beg you.

772
00:31:34,720 --> 00:31:35,030
Come on,

773
00:31:35,030 --> 00:31:35,590
let me...

774
00:31:35,590 --> 00:31:36,270
L-Let me put it on you.

775
00:31:36,270 --> 00:31:37,920
Will this work?

776
00:31:38,310 --> 00:31:39,160
So,

777
00:31:39,200 --> 00:31:40,110
when you see yourself

778
00:31:40,110 --> 00:31:41,400
grabbing something,

779
00:31:42,440 --> 00:31:44,350
j-just snap it.

780
00:31:51,270 --> 00:31:52,350
What's the use of this?

781
00:31:52,350 --> 00:31:52,830
Well,

782
00:31:52,830 --> 00:31:54,160
it's like this. Like this.

783
00:31:54,160 --> 00:31:55,350
Look.

784
00:31:55,350 --> 00:31:56,240
I dare you.

785
00:31:57,460 --> 00:31:58,540
[Our service includes what others don't do.
Our duty covers what everyone does.]

786
00:31:58,590 --> 00:31:59,400
No, no...

787
00:32:00,510 --> 00:32:01,880
You said it too late.

788
00:32:02,070 --> 00:32:03,000
It hurts!

789
00:32:03,030 --> 00:32:04,550
Yes, I know it hurts.

790
00:32:04,700 --> 00:32:09,810
[Our service includes what others don't do.
Our duty covers what everyone does.]

791
00:32:04,880 --> 00:32:06,750
It only works if it hurts, right?

792
00:32:06,920 --> 00:32:08,310
I just want to...

793
00:32:08,720 --> 00:32:09,550
I'm sorry.

794
00:32:12,750 --> 00:32:13,480
How did you come up

795
00:32:13,480 --> 00:32:14,880
with such an awful idea?

796
00:32:14,880 --> 00:32:15,510
No,

797
00:32:15,880 --> 00:32:17,680
I don't have the brains for that.

798
00:32:19,400 --> 00:32:20,330
I came up with it.

799
00:32:23,550 --> 00:32:24,350
Xiaozhu,

800
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:26,440
I... I treat you

801
00:32:26,440 --> 00:32:27,480
like my own son.

802
00:32:27,720 --> 00:32:28,720
I know.

803
00:32:29,110 --> 00:32:31,510
I've always treated you
like my own mother.

804
00:32:31,510 --> 00:32:32,510
So this time, I...

805
00:32:32,510 --> 00:32:33,510
I'm with my dad.

806
00:32:34,750 --> 00:32:35,550
Mom.

807
00:32:36,480 --> 00:32:37,880
When you were in prison,

808
00:32:38,880 --> 00:32:40,750
I felt terrible at the thought

809
00:32:41,510 --> 00:32:43,030
of you suffering in there.

810
00:32:45,110 --> 00:32:45,920
Mom,

811
00:32:46,920 --> 00:32:48,310
we are family.

812
00:32:49,030 --> 00:32:50,690
We all hope you can correct it.

813
00:32:51,000 --> 00:32:52,460
Our daughter also agrees.

814
00:32:54,400 --> 00:32:55,260
How about this?

815
00:32:56,110 --> 00:32:57,170
I'll do it with you.

816
00:32:57,480 --> 00:32:58,400
Let me join you.

817
00:32:58,680 --> 00:32:59,750
You snap, and I'll snap too.

818
00:32:59,750 --> 00:33:00,480
I'll snap too, Mom.

819
00:33:00,480 --> 00:33:01,270
I'll do 3.

820
00:33:05,830 --> 00:33:06,920
Who was that just now?

821
00:33:05,900 --> 00:33:08,400
[Our service includes what others don't do.
Our duty covers what everyone does.]

822
00:33:07,000 --> 00:33:07,680
You.

823
00:33:07,680 --> 00:33:08,400
Don't run.

824
00:33:23,440 --> 00:33:24,840
Done walking the horses?

825
00:33:27,090 --> 00:33:31,130
[Recommended for you]

826
00:33:28,550 --> 00:33:29,510
Xiaoximen Hospital

827
00:33:29,510 --> 00:33:30,590
is closed down.

828
00:33:35,440 --> 00:33:36,240
What?

829
00:33:38,200 --> 00:33:40,200
Xiaoximen Hospital is closed down?

830
00:33:45,830 --> 00:33:47,630
Why aren't you saying anything?

831
00:33:49,070 --> 00:33:50,930
It has nothing to do with us at all.

832
00:33:52,000 --> 00:33:53,930
What's the use of saying anything?

833
00:34:06,680 --> 00:34:08,800
You've been acting weird
since you got here a few days ago.

834
00:34:08,800 --> 00:34:10,460
What exactly do you want to do?

835
00:34:12,150 --> 00:34:13,210
What do I want to do?

836
00:34:14,760 --> 00:34:16,030
To learn from you.

837
00:34:17,630 --> 00:34:19,960
Learn how to escape reality.

838
00:34:21,280 --> 00:34:22,480
We are not different.

839
00:34:23,320 --> 00:34:24,780
You're even worse than me.

840
00:34:25,320 --> 00:34:26,920
At least I know what I'm like,

841
00:34:27,710 --> 00:34:28,510
unlike you.

842
00:34:29,510 --> 00:34:31,510
You can't accept that you're trash.

843
00:34:37,070 --> 00:34:37,960
Say that again.

844
00:34:42,440 --> 00:34:43,840
I said you're trash.

845
00:35:25,440 --> 00:35:26,230
I'm sorry.

846
00:35:28,280 --> 00:35:29,080
My apologies.

847
00:35:49,480 --> 00:35:51,150
Look at my new hair color.

848
00:35:51,320 --> 00:35:52,320
Isn't it stylish?

849
00:36:16,880 --> 00:36:17,670
Do you think Long

850
00:36:17,670 --> 00:36:19,270
has something up his sleeve?

851
00:36:19,880 --> 00:36:20,480
No idea.

852
00:36:21,630 --> 00:36:23,510
Not going to work every day

853
00:36:24,480 --> 00:36:25,440
