854
00:36:25,440 --> 00:36:26,280
I didn't see you

855
00:36:26,280 --> 00:36:27,670
busy working before.

856
00:36:28,230 --> 00:36:29,320
You slacked off every day.

857
00:36:29,320 --> 00:36:31,650
Lying down at work is called slacking off.

858
00:36:32,430 --> 00:36:34,710
Lying down while not at work
is just lying down.

859
00:36:34,710 --> 00:36:35,880
It feels different.

860
00:36:35,880 --> 00:36:37,550
You're not lying down.
You're on your stomach.

861
00:36:37,550 --> 00:36:39,000
Doesn't it feel right?

862
00:36:43,280 --> 00:36:44,070
What's wrong?

863
00:36:44,070 --> 00:36:44,840
You...

864
00:36:45,280 --> 00:36:47,190
You a-are massaging way too hard.

865
00:36:47,190 --> 00:36:47,590
Is that so?

866
00:36:47,590 --> 00:36:48,400
Rubbing this spot

867
00:36:48,400 --> 00:36:49,360
can easily cause problems.

868
00:36:49,360 --> 00:36:50,920
You need to be gentler.

869
00:36:51,510 --> 00:36:51,960
Okay, okay.

870
00:36:51,960 --> 00:36:52,890
I'll go gentler.

871
00:36:57,880 --> 00:36:58,760
Hey, pause...

872
00:36:59,510 --> 00:37:01,480
When rubbing the large muscle group
in the shoulder,

873
00:37:01,480 --> 00:37:02,960
y-you need to apply

874
00:37:02,960 --> 00:37:04,150
deeper pressure.

875
00:37:04,150 --> 00:37:05,550
Okay, I'll go harder.

876
00:37:09,440 --> 00:37:10,230
What is it?

877
00:37:10,400 --> 00:37:11,400
Time's not up yet.

878
00:37:13,590 --> 00:37:14,510
You, honestly...

879
00:37:14,510 --> 00:37:15,360
Come on...

880
00:37:15,360 --> 00:37:16,000
You lie down.

881
00:37:16,000 --> 00:37:16,840
Let me teach you. Come on.

882
00:37:16,840 --> 00:37:18,280
Careful not to break his back.

883
00:37:18,280 --> 00:37:19,000
Come on...

884
00:37:19,070 --> 00:37:19,840
Well...

885
00:37:19,840 --> 00:37:21,510
Massage is all about this,

886
00:37:21,760 --> 00:37:22,670
like Tai Chi.

887
00:37:22,670 --> 00:37:23,280
Look, look.

888
00:37:23,280 --> 00:37:24,920
This is the right pressure, huh?

889
00:37:24,920 --> 00:37:25,710
Right?

890
00:37:25,760 --> 00:37:27,030
-We can tell you're bored.
-You have to work

891
00:37:27,030 --> 00:37:29,070
this pressure deeper into the muscle.

892
00:37:29,070 --> 00:37:29,920
H-How is it?

893
00:37:30,190 --> 00:37:31,000
Nice.

894
00:37:31,000 --> 00:37:31,440
Right?

895
00:37:31,440 --> 00:37:32,640
Check out this force.

896
00:37:32,670 --> 00:37:33,760
And then on top, um,

897
00:37:33,760 --> 00:37:34,890
use the elbow. Look.

898
00:37:35,030 --> 00:37:36,480
Right? Check this out.

899
00:37:37,150 --> 00:37:37,960
Tong,

900
00:37:38,030 --> 00:37:38,920
if we two go

901
00:37:38,920 --> 00:37:40,480
to the Traditional Chinese Massage
Department

902
00:37:40,480 --> 00:37:41,440
in our hospital,

903
00:37:41,440 --> 00:37:42,760
I'd probably be the chief physician,

904
00:37:42,760 --> 00:37:43,320
you know?

905
00:37:43,320 --> 00:37:45,050
What are you two talking about?

906
00:37:48,030 --> 00:37:49,890
President, what brings you here?

907
00:37:52,320 --> 00:37:53,070
President, what do you

908
00:37:53,070 --> 00:37:54,800
think of my massage technique?

909
00:37:54,880 --> 00:37:55,960
Give me an evaluation.

910
00:37:55,960 --> 00:37:56,710
Now that the hospital is gone,

911
00:37:56,710 --> 00:37:58,150
why still call me President?

912
00:37:58,150 --> 00:38:00,030
Well, even if the hospital is gone,
you're still the President.

913
00:38:00,030 --> 00:38:01,110
I came to this hospital

914
00:38:01,110 --> 00:38:02,480
just because of you.

915
00:38:05,880 --> 00:38:06,960
Huang, tell me,

916
00:38:08,630 --> 00:38:10,400
if Xiaoximen Hospital were still open,

917
00:38:10,400 --> 00:38:12,060
what would its future be like?

918
00:38:12,550 --> 00:38:13,360
I...

919
00:38:14,400 --> 00:38:16,530
I-I haven't thought about the future.

920
00:38:16,880 --> 00:38:17,710
I just think

921
00:38:17,710 --> 00:38:18,710
Xiaoximen Hospital was

922
00:38:18,710 --> 00:38:20,440
doing pretty well the way it was.

923
00:38:20,440 --> 00:38:21,190
Well, even though

924
00:38:21,190 --> 00:38:22,550
most of its medical facilities

925
00:38:22,550 --> 00:38:24,750
were not as good as other big hospitals,

926
00:38:24,920 --> 00:38:26,590
if anyone living around there

927
00:38:26,590 --> 00:38:27,670
had a headache or a fever,

928
00:38:27,670 --> 00:38:28,280
our Xiaoximen

929
00:38:28,280 --> 00:38:28,960
would definitely be

930
00:38:28,960 --> 00:38:30,070
the place to go.

931
00:38:30,630 --> 00:38:32,630
Then why did you slack off every day?

932
00:38:33,000 --> 00:38:34,460
You thought I didn't know?

933
00:38:34,840 --> 00:38:36,230
I... I...

934
00:38:36,230 --> 00:38:37,670
I-I did slack off at the hospital,

935
00:38:37,670 --> 00:38:38,230
but I...

936
00:38:38,230 --> 00:38:39,150
I offered

937
00:38:39,150 --> 00:38:40,840
free medical care after work, you know.

938
00:38:40,840 --> 00:38:42,000
Y-You can go ask around

939
00:38:42,000 --> 00:38:43,800
on the streets nearby.

940
00:38:44,150 --> 00:38:45,810
I have cured numerous ladies.

941
00:38:45,960 --> 00:38:47,360
If you could treat people on the streets,

942
00:38:47,360 --> 00:38:49,280
why couldn't you treat them at Xiaoximen?

943
00:38:49,280 --> 00:38:50,070
Here's the thing.

944
00:38:50,070 --> 00:38:52,030
Look at Liu, Zhengliang,

945
00:38:52,030 --> 00:38:53,030
and Mingming now.

946
00:38:53,710 --> 00:38:54,880
Every one of them

947
00:38:54,880 --> 00:38:56,280
treats patients better than I do.

948
00:38:56,280 --> 00:38:57,480
They're doing great.

949
00:38:57,510 --> 00:38:59,230
I'm just falling behind.

950
00:39:01,000 --> 00:39:02,000
Do you think Xiaoximen

951
00:39:02,000 --> 00:39:03,930
is just a place to treat illnesses?

952
00:39:04,960 --> 00:39:06,890
If it's about treating illnesses,

953
00:39:07,360 --> 00:39:10,160
it's indeed nowhere near
as good as big hospitals.

954
00:39:10,230 --> 00:39:12,030
It's only fair that it's closed.

955
00:39:23,030 --> 00:39:24,110
President Long,

956
00:39:24,630 --> 00:39:25,920
I-I don't agree

957
00:39:26,000 --> 00:39:26,960
with you on that.

958
00:39:26,960 --> 00:39:27,710
I... I...

959
00:39:27,800 --> 00:39:28,710
In my point of view,

960
00:39:28,710 --> 00:39:30,590
Xiaoximen serves a purpose

961
00:39:31,880 --> 00:39:33,190
j-just like this...

962
00:39:33,630 --> 00:39:35,510
j-just like this big tree here.

963
00:39:35,670 --> 00:39:36,360
Like the trees...

964
00:39:36,360 --> 00:39:37,550
Like the trees around here

965
00:39:37,550 --> 00:39:38,590
in Central Park.

966
00:39:38,590 --> 00:39:39,280
Well...

967
00:39:40,710 --> 00:39:41,440
They might

968
00:39:41,440 --> 00:39:42,440
n-not appear conspicuous,

969
00:39:42,440 --> 00:39:43,590
but once you chop them all down

970
00:39:43,590 --> 00:39:44,920
in one fell swoop,

971
00:39:45,360 --> 00:39:46,550
people won't have a place

972
00:39:46,550 --> 00:39:47,800
to rest in the shade anymore.

973
00:39:47,800 --> 00:39:49,800
And including the ones having massages

974
00:39:49,800 --> 00:39:51,550
or acupuncture,
or even the ones dancing over there—

975
00:39:51,550 --> 00:39:53,080
everyone will be affected.

976
00:40:00,030 --> 00:40:00,880
You're picking up

977
00:40:00,880 --> 00:40:02,110
my way of talking now.

978
00:40:04,190 --> 00:40:04,880
What's wrong?

979
00:40:04,880 --> 00:40:05,190
Hold on.

980
00:40:05,190 --> 00:40:06,510
You may turn over. I need to...

981
00:40:06,510 --> 00:40:08,320
I need to rub your b-back.

982
00:40:09,880 --> 00:40:11,360
I'm not here for a massage.

983
00:40:15,400 --> 00:40:17,000
President, are you leaving?

984
00:40:24,880 --> 00:40:27,960
Did I...
Did I say anything that offended him?

985
00:40:30,620 --> 00:40:33,910
[Restricted area;
Authorized personnel only]

986
00:40:57,480 --> 00:40:58,280
What's wrong?

987
00:41:03,280 --> 00:41:04,070
Mingming.

988
00:41:04,590 --> 00:41:05,400
Listen.

989
00:41:05,630 --> 00:41:06,690
Listen carefully.

990
00:41:07,800 --> 00:41:09,060
Did you hear anything?

991
00:41:09,400 --> 00:41:10,190
What is it?

992
00:41:14,510 --> 00:41:15,570
The sound of a seal!

993
00:41:16,630 --> 00:41:17,070
Nope.

994
00:41:17,760 --> 00:41:19,560
I went to the aquarium yesterday

995
00:41:20,150 --> 00:41:21,440
and saw a seal.

996
00:41:23,150 --> 00:41:24,280
It must be that seal.

997
00:41:24,480 --> 00:41:25,360
The aquarium you went to

998
00:41:25,360 --> 00:41:26,760
is 7 or 8 kilometers away.

999
00:41:27,030 --> 00:41:28,030
If you could hear it from here,

1000
00:41:28,030 --> 00:41:29,360
half of Fucheng could hear it, too.

1001
00:41:29,360 --> 00:41:30,560
The seal must be using

1002
00:41:30,670 --> 00:41:31,590
frequencies beyond

1003
00:41:31,590 --> 00:41:32,510
the range of human hearing

1004
00:41:32,510 --> 00:41:33,590
to communicate with me

1005
00:41:33,590 --> 00:41:34,630
and ask for help.

1006
00:41:36,800 --> 00:41:37,510
Dad.

1007
00:41:38,150 --> 00:41:38,920
Dad.

1008
00:41:39,550 --> 00:41:40,550
You're human, too.

1009
00:41:40,550 --> 00:41:41,920
I'm no ordinary human.

1010
00:41:43,030 --> 00:41:44,670
I can receive signals.

1011
00:41:48,840 --> 00:41:49,630
Dad.

1012
00:41:50,920 --> 00:41:53,000
I heard the signals would be stronger

1013
00:41:53,000 --> 00:41:54,330
when people are asleep.

1014
00:42:04,760 --> 00:42:05,880
Be quiet.

1015
00:42:04,790 --> 00:42:08,610
[Underwater Tunnel]

1016
00:42:06,710 --> 00:42:08,310
I'll change the song for you.

1017
00:42:08,710 --> 00:42:10,840
I have a donkey,

1018
00:42:11,150 --> 00:42:12,960
but I never ride it.

1019
00:42:21,360 --> 00:42:22,070
Dad.

1020
00:42:26,670 --> 00:42:28,630
Dad, are you up?

1021
00:42:39,800 --> 00:42:40,550
Dad.

1022
00:42:41,150 --> 00:42:43,010
Would you like to have breakfast?

1023
00:42:45,670 --> 00:42:46,760
I'm coming in.

1024
00:43:11,880 --> 00:43:13,400
D-Do you want to eat fish?
